y censored. The game has a 16+ rating in most countries. It has an 18+ rating in Germany. The game is banned in Indonesia due to the depiction of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T17:53:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055886059","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4517570-1838407329269234","game_id":"steam-4517570","kind":"announcement","title":"STARCULT public demo launches on Steam on July 27.","summary":"STARCULT: Night Twisted Age, a dark fantasy mystery visual novel where you uncover secrets, build relationships, and shape Sylviya's personality through a unique Emotion Palette system.Looking forward to seeing you play!Key DEMO FeaturesUse the Emotion Palette to unlock up to 15 different dialogue options within a single conversationUncover multiple story routes and demo endings shaped by your choicesInvestigate a murder mystery filled with secrets, manipulation and supernatural forcesCan you di","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T15:06:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329269234","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4517570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4517570":"2026-10-26T02:52:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4517570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4646520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
